---
import { site } from "../data/site";
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<section id="descarga" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl scroll-mt-20 px-4 pb-20 sm:px-6">
  <div data-reveal class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-crema px-6 py-14 text-center sm:px-12">
    <img src="/img/logo.png" alt="" width="88" height="88" class="mx-auto h-20 w-20" />
    <h2 class="mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-semibold sm:text-5xl">Muy pronto en Android</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-arena">
      Soltá Ve está en su etapa final de desarrollo. Escríbenos si quieres probarla antes que nadie.
    </p>
    <a href={site.contact[0].href} data-button class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-coral px-7 py-3 font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-coral/30">
      Quiero probarla
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="border-t border-linea">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-6 px-4 py-10 text-sm text-arena sm:flex-row sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <img src="/img/logo.png" alt="" width="32" height="32" class="h-8 w-8" />
      <p>© {year} {site.name} · by {site.author}. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="flex gap-6 font-medium">
      {site.contact.map((c) => (
        <li><a href={c.href} class="transition-colors hover:text-coral" target={c.href.startsWith("http") ? "_blank" : undefined} rel="noopener">{c.label}</a></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</footer>
